#: Chasing_the_Light/scenarios/04_Daeola.cfg:1939
#: Chasing_the_Light/scenarios/04_Daeola.cfg:2060
#: Chasing_the_Light/scenarios/04_Daeola.cfg:3091
#: Chasing_the_Light/scenarios/05_Aftermath.cfg:227
#: Chasing_the_Light/scenarios/05_Aftermath.cfg:1855
#: Chasing_the_Light/scenarios/06_Miscreants.cfg:1015
#: Chasing_the_Light/scenarios/06_Miscreants.cfg:1982
#: Chasing_the_Light/scenarios/06_Miscreants.cfg:2013
#: Chasing_the_Light/scenarios/06_Miscreants.cfg:2138
#: Chasing_the_Light/scenarios/06_Miscreants.cfg:3207
