#. Загибель Аси
#: Chasing_the_Light/scenarios/05_Aftermath.cfg:232
#: Chasing_the_Light/scenarios/05_Aftermath.cfg:1859
#: Chasing_the_Light/scenarios/06_Miscreants.cfg:1019
#: Chasing_the_Light/scenarios/06_Miscreants.cfg:1986
